library "Condition Status".
terminology "Finding Codes":
- system is `http://example.org/findings`.
- code is `finding`.
concept "Findings":
- shape is RecordSet.
- type is Condition.
- coded from "Finding Codes".
concept "Active Findings":
- shape is RecordSet.
- type is Condition.
- definition is "Findings" active.
concept "Verified Findings":
- shape is RecordSet.
- type is Condition.
- definition is "Active Findings" verified.
concept "Finding Exists":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Verified Findings" ).
activity "Eligible":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `ELIGIBLE`.
activity "Not Eligible":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `NOT_ELIGIBLE`.
decision "D":
first:
- when "Finding Exists" then recommend activity "Eligible".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Not Eligible".
